# User Roles

## Jonathan

Role: Administrator

Privileges:
- Full sudo access
- User management
- System administration

## Engineer

Role: OT Engineer

Privileges:
- Diagnostics
- Log review
- Service monitoring

Restrictions:
- No package installation
- No user management

## OTOperator

Role: OT Operator

Privileges:
- Login access
- Basic monitoring

Restrictions:
- No sudo access
- No configuration changes
